rsal USA\n115 E Stevens Ave, Suite 208, Valhalla, NY 10595\nEmail: salesusa@schmersal.com\nWebsite: www.schmersalusa.com",1781700901000,"National SAFER Workplace Day presentation 2023","https:\u002F\u002Fyoutu.be\u002FI4G-uhB6SvI",{"node":1660},{"id":1661,"thumbnail":1662,"description":1663,"published":1664,"title":1665,"url":1666},"rD2dEplTubg","https:\u002F\u002Fi.ytimg.com\u002Fvi\u002FrD2dEplTubg\u002Fsddefault.jpg","In this 1-hour product presentation, Nick Styler and Ryan Davison demonstrated our system solutions to reduce wiring and provide data to fieldbus systems. Products include: Passive Field Box, Input Expansion control modules, Y connectors, Serial Diagnostic components, and Safety Field Box (SFB).\n\nWe explored practical approaches to reducing installation labor, minimizing downtime, and increasing operational efficiency across machines of all sizes. Whether you're working with small standalone machines or large, complex systems, we provide actionable strategies to reduce costs and improve performance.\n\n00:00:00 Start\n00:00:02 Introductions\n00:01:41 Agenda\n00:02:48 Passive Field Box (PFB)\n00:06:13 Safety Relays (input expansion)\n00:08:33 Serial Diagnostics (SD)\n00:18:38 Wiring Solutions for SD\n00:22:25 SD Gateways\n00:29:09 Safety Field Box (SFB)\n00:41:37 Parameter settings\n00:44:47 Installation topology\n00:46:33 SFB Technical data and LED diagnostics\n00:49:58 SFB Webserver\n00:51:07 Configurations for Fieldbus\n00:54:52 System Engineering tool\n00:59:26 Conclusion\n\n\n\nFor more information, contact:\nSchmersal USA\n115 E Stevens Ave, Suite 208, Valhalla, NY 10595\nEmail: salesusa@schmersal.com\nWebsite: www.schmersalusa.com",1781190390000,"Schmersal System Solutions to Reduce Wiring & Maximize Machine Uptime","https:\u002F\u002Fyoutu.be\u002FrD2dEplTubg",{"edges":1668},[1669,1678,1687],{"node":1670},{"type":1354,"linkUrl":1671,"linkText":1672,"id":1673,"name":1672,"primaryImage":1674},"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.schmersalusa.com\u002Fprodu